Icons shown by the extension
----------------------------
Icons are loaded at runtime from dashboardicons.com and its CDNs and are not
part of the extension. The only exception are the test fixtures in test/images
(ntfy and portabase files), copied unchanged from
https://github.com/homarr-labs/dashboard-icons under the Apache License 2.0
to test image size detection. Logos and brand marks belong to their respective
owners. Icons from external catalogs (selfh.st, LobeHub, Simple Icons) keep
their own licenses, which the extension shows in the icon details.
